paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{l}
  {\Delta A_{i} = \frac{1}{2}r_{i}^{2}\Delta\theta - \frac{1}{2}r_{i - 1}^{2}\Delta\theta = \frac{1}{2}(r_{i}^{2} - r_{i - 1}^{2})\Delta\theta} \\
  {\phantom{\Delta A_{i}} = \frac{1}{2}(r_{i} + r_{i - 1})(r_{i} - r_{i - 1})\Delta\theta = r_{i}^{*}\Delta r\Delta\theta}
  \end{array}$$
